13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# Cold Email in 2026: Strategies, Tools, and Best Practices That Get Replies"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," Cold email remains one of the most effective B2B outreach channels -- *when done right*. In 2026, generic blasts are dead. This guide covers AI-powered personalization at scale, deliverability best practices backed by inbox provider data, and high-converting follow-up sequences -- all grounded in real-world benchmarks and actionable tactics."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","6",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Why Cold Email Still Dominates (Spoiler: It's Not Dead -- It's Evolved)"}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Despite predictions of its demise, cold email continues to outperform nearly every other outbound channel for early-stage B2B sales. According to a 2025 Sales Benchmark Report by Gong, ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"cold email drives 2.3× more qualified meetings per rep than LinkedIn InMail"}],", and companies using structured cold email sequences see ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"47% higher reply rates"}]," than those relying on ad-hoc outreach."]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["But here's the critical shift: *open rates alone are meaningless*. In 2026, success is measured by ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"reply rate"}],", ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"meeting-booking rate"}],", and ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"inbox placement rate"}]," -- not just whether someone opened your message."]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> 🔑 ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Key Stat"}],": Mailgun's 2026 Deliverability Index shows that emails landing in the *primary tab* (not Promotions or Spam) generate ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"6.8× more replies"}]," than those filtered elsewhere."]}],["$","hr","14",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","16",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"1. Personalization at Scale: Beyond \"Hi {First Name}\""}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Generic personalization (\"I saw your recent post on AI\") is now table stakes -- and often counterproductive. Top-performing teams in 2026 use *layered, intent-driven personalization*, combining:"]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Firmographic triggers"}]," (e.g., funding round, tech stack change detected via Clearbit + Apollo)"]}],["$","p","21",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Behavioral signals"}]," (e.g., visiting pricing page 3x in 7 days -- tracked via Bitly UTM + HubSpot)"]}],["$","p","22",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ","$L17"," (e.g., referencing a recent earnings call quote *and* tying it to a specific challenge their CFO mentioned)"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e